<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Reset your password</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h1 style="color: #333;">Reset your password</h1>
  <p>You requested to reset your password. Please use the token below:</p>
  <p style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; word-break: break-all;">{{token}}</p>
  <p>Visit the password reset page and enter the token above to set a new password.</p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">This token expires in {{expiresIn}}.</p>
</body>
</html>
